<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 163.83 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 163.83 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 163.83 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after selling 83.56 million rand's worth Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
